# Curated evidence-showcase inventory.
#
# This file contains discoverability and traceability metadata only.
# `*_path_state` records whether a path exists now or is planned; it must never
# drive showcase evidence status. Status, freshness, results, and artifact truth
# come only from validated evidence manifests.

